WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.094
Tom was in the Royal Lab.

2
00:00:05.095 --> 00:00:09.933
He was mixing a potion.

3
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:14.312
"I need a potion to undo spells," he said.

4
00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:17.336
"I make so many mistakes!"

5
00:00:17.337 --> 00:00:24.549
Cat licked a paw and watched.

6
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:34.946
Tom mixed water with some herbs.

7
00:00:34.947 --> 00:00:41.858
He added dragon scales and flower petals.

8
00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:50.957
The potion turned bright green.

9
00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:53.815
Princess Mary hurried into the lab.

10
00:00:53.816 --> 00:00:56.381
"Wizard!" she said.

11
00:00:56.382 --> 00:00:58.099
"I need help!"

12
00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.980
Tom bowed quickly.

13
00:00:59.981 --> 00:01:02.084
He bumped his head on the table.

14
00:01:02.085 --> 00:01:04.346
"Ouch!" he cried.

15
00:01:04.347 --> 00:01:06.762
"What's wrong, Princess?"

16
00:01:06.763 --> 00:01:10.204
Princess Mary sighed.

17
00:01:10.205 --> 00:01:12.795
"Father wants me to get married.

18
00:01:12.796 --> 00:01:16.646
So five princes are coming to the palace tomorrow.

19
00:01:16.647 --> 00:01:20.315
I must choose one for my husband."

20
00:01:20.316 --> 00:01:23.861
"Do you want to get married?" Tom asked.

21
00:01:23.862 --> 00:01:27.594
"Maybe. . ." The princess blushed.

22
00:01:27.595 --> 00:01:30.646
"If one of the princes is nice.

23
00:01:30.647 --> 00:01:34.195
But how can I tell if one is truly nice?"

24
00:01:34.196 --> 00:01:37.467
Tom scratched his head.

25
00:01:37.468 --> 00:01:40.103
"That is a problem."

26
00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:44.049
"Can you use magic?" Princess Mary asked.

27
00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:47.240
"You could find the nicest prince for me!"

28
00:01:47.241 --> 00:01:49.473
"Okay," Tom said.

29
00:01:49.474 --> 00:01:50.953
"I will try!"

30
00:01:50.954 --> 00:01:53.962
He bowed again.

31
00:01:53.963 --> 00:01:57.123
This time he knocked over the potion.

32
00:01:57.124 --> 00:02:00.487
It spilled on the table.

33
00:02:00.488 --> 00:02:06.030
Poof! The table disappeared.

34
00:02:06.031 --> 00:02:12.874
"Oops!" Tom's face turned bright red.

35
00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:16.046
Princess Mary smiled at Tom.

36
00:02:16.047 --> 00:02:18.552
"Thank you, Tom," she said.

37
00:02:18.553 --> 00:02:29.713
"You are a very kind wizard!"

